    -- addon:data.affix_text.each_void_bolt_tears_open_a_void_zone_un:text
    ["Each Void Bolt tears open a Void Zone under its target: non-boss enemies within 6 yd are dragged to its center, and every enemy within 6 yd takes @value@15%@value@ @range@[5%-15%]@range@ more damage from your Shadow spells for 4 sec (Does not stack)"] = "Each Void Bolt tears open a Void Zone under its target: non-boss enemies within 6 yd are dragged to its center, and every enemy within 6 yd takes @value@15%@value@ @range@[5%-15%]@range@ more damage from your Shadow spells for 4 sec (Does not stack)",
