    -- addon:data.affix_text.when_your_rejuvenation_expires_or_jumps:text
    ["When your Rejuvenation expires or jumps to another ally, it leaves an Emerald flower for 6 sec that heals allies within 5 yd for @value@50%@value@ @range@[10%-50%]@range@ of your Spell Power every second (Does not stack)"] = "When your Rejuvenation expires or jumps to another ally, it leaves an Emerald flower for 6 sec that heals allies within 5 yd for @value@50%@value@ @range@[10%-50%]@range@ of your Spell Power every second (Does not stack)",
    -- addon:data.mountdesc.58983:text
    ["Whenever you ride this mount, you feel the urge to shout, \"Cry havoc and let slip the murlocs of war!\""] = "Chaque fois que vous chevauchez cette monture, vous ressentez l'envie de crier : « Hurlez au carnage et lâchez les murlocs de guerre ! »",
    -- addon:data.affix_text.while_bestial_wrath_is_active_each_kill:text
