    ["Your Death and Decay becomes Felmyst's demonic vapor: it deals @value@50%@value@ @range@[10%-50%]@range@ more damage, and enemies that die in it rise as ghouls that fight for you for 10 sec (Does not stack)"] = "Your Death and Decay becomes Felmyst's demonic vapor: it deals @value@50%@value@ @range@[10%-50%]@range@ more damage, and enemies that die in it rise as ghouls that fight for you for 10 sec (Does not stack)",
